      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 0,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Now that I have a cooktop, \r\nI can cook simple meals!\r\nIt's a relief to finally be able to \r\ndo something chef-like.",
        "Jp" : "調理台ができたから\r\n簡単な料理なら作れるようになったんだ！\r\nやっと料理人らしいことができるようになって\r\nなんだか安心しちゃった"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 627818,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 1,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "But I guess the problem is that fire is a bit \r\ndifficult to handle in the \r\ncurrent circumstances.",
        "Jp" : "でも、今の環境じゃ火の扱いが\r\nちょっと難しいのが悩みどころかなぁ"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 674942,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 2,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "I want to make sure that raw food is well heated \r\nso that we don't get sick from what we eat, \r\nprecisely because of this situation...",
        "Jp" : "こんな状況だからこそ\r\n食べるもので病気になったりしないように\r\n生ものはしっかり加熱したいんだけど――"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 674943,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 3,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "The hearth... \r\nI wonder if it can be fixed somehow.",
        "Jp" : "釜戸、何とか直せないかなぁ"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 674944,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    } ],
    "NameDispOff" : false,
    "NpcId" : 580,
    "NpcName" : {
      "En" : "Carrie",
      "Jp" : "キャリー"
    }
  }, {
    "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgGroup",
    "GroupNameSerial" : 0,
    "GroupSerial" : 25717,
    "GroupType" : 0,
    "GroupTypeName" : "MSG_GROUP_TYPE_NONE",
    "MsgData" : [ {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 4,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Well, I have an idea for fixing the hearth.",
        "Jp" : "あのね、釜戸を直す材料には\r\n心当たりがあって――"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 627819,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 5,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "If we have <COL ff2600>[Clay Soil]</COL>, I think \r\nI and the Liberation Army could cooperate to fix it. \r\nI remember the structure of the hearth, after all.",
        "Jp" : "<COL ff2600>《粘土質の土》</COL>があれば、アタシと解放軍の人とで\r\n協力して直せると思うんだよね\r\n釜戸の構造はアタシが覚えてるからさ"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 674938,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 6,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "<COL ff2600>[Clay Soil]</COL>... \r\nI think I saw it on my way to Piremoth. \r\nI remember catching a glimpse of it while I \r\nwas on my way to deliver supplies—\r\njust a fleeting memory.",
        "Jp" : "<COL ff2600>《粘土質の土》</COL>ね\r\nピレモスに行く途中で見た気がするんだ\r\nほら、食料を届けにいく途中で\r\nちらっと目にした記憶が――"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 678305,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 7,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "I wonder if I could find it when we next go to \r\nPiremoth. That would be a win-win, right? \r\nAlright, let's go search for it.",
        "Jp" : "今度ピレモスに行く時にでも見つけられないかなぁ\r\nそしたら一石二鳥だよね\r\nよし、探してみよう"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 674940,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 8,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Hey, just in case I get too focused on dodging \r\nmonsters, could you keep it in mind? \r\nThat clay-rich soil I was telling you about, \r\nnear Piremoth, okay?",
        "Jp" : "もしかしたらアタシ、魔物を避けるので\r\n必死になってるかもしれないから\r\nあなたも一応覚えておいてくれない？\r\nピレモスに行く途中で<COL ff2600>《粘土質の土》</COL>、ってさ"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 674941,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    } ],
    "NameDispOff" : false,
    "NpcId" : 580,
    "NpcName" : {
      "En" : "Carrie",
      "Jp" : "キャリー"
    }
